Files: assets/fonts/NotoSans*.ttf assets/fonts/LICENSE-NotoSans.txt
Copyright: 2022 The Noto Project Authors
 2014-2021 Adobe
Comment: Subsets of Noto Sans Devanagari UI and Noto Sans CJK SC, cut down to
 the characters this login screen draws. Roboto carries no Devanagari and no
 Han, so without them the Hindi and Chinese columns are rows of empty boxes.
 Neither family declares a Reserved Font Name, so the subsets keep their
 original names.
License: OFL-1.1
 The complete SIL Open Font License version 1.1 is available in
 /usr/share/doc/cedm/LICENSE-NotoSans.txt and at
 https://openfontlicense.org.

